## Keeping this project in sync with the template

This project was generated with [Copier](https://copier.readthedocs.io/). When the
template gets an improvement you want (a security fix, a CI upgrade, a new
component), pull it in with:

```bash
uvx copier update
```

Copier 3-way-merges the template's changes against your project, prompting only on
real conflicts. Commit before running it, same as any merge.
